// "Iron Front" — Command & Conquer: Red Alert. Allies and the Soviet Union with their own barracks, units,
// defences and superweapons. The MCV deploys into a construction yard; structures are built in the sidebar and
// placed next to the base. Harvesters bring ore (and gems, worth double) to refineries; credits are capped by the
// storage of refineries and silos. Power plants feed the base: a deficit halves production and switches off
// defences and the radar. Vehicles crush infantry, engineers capture buildings (and are used up), Tanya blows up
// buildings with C4. Prices, hit points and the armor table follow the public Red Alert rules.ini.
// Not yet here (engine plan): aircraft with airfields and ammo, navy, transports (APC), spies, chronosphere teleport.
